+
+        Mathematically identical to looping ``build_layer_updated_cache`` over
+        every layer, but computed as a handful of layer-batched einsums instead of
+        ``num_layers`` separate launches. Returns k/v of shape [L, B, N, S, A].
+        """
+        L = self.num_layers
+        A = self.attn_hidden_dim
+        H, Dh = self.num_heads, self.head_dim
